{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774044551,"nonce":"Yvp6jCFTlsiEqs4aLiQSp/a5Y2E=","title":"Webhook ingestion endpoint for CI/monitoring event injection","message":"Add POST /api/webhooks/ingest endpoint that accepts structured events from external systems (CI, monitoring, GitHub) and routes them to appropriate agent sessions.\n\n## Design\n- Accepts JSON payload: { source, event_type, data, target_issue?, target_branch?, target_session? }\n- Routing logic:\n  - If target_session specified: sendPrompt() to that session\n  - If target_issue specified: find the work unit, find the assigned session, sendPrompt()\n  - If target_branch specified: find sessions on that branch, sendPrompt()\n  - If no target: queue as inbox item for manual dispatch\n- For channel-connected sessions: route via channel notification instead of sendPrompt()\n- For sessions with no live agent: queue as inbox item\n\n## Differences from Claude remote control API\n- Remote control is for controlling a single Claude Code TUI instance\n- This is for external systems pushing events INTO Mandible's dispatch system\n- Mandible routes to any session, queues when no session is available, applies filtering\n\n## Use cases\n- CI failure notification → agent on that branch gets notified\n- Deployment alert → operator agent investigates\n- GitHub PR review → agent on that issue gets the review comments\n- Monitoring alert → spawn or wake an agent to investigate","files":null}]}